FFmpeg / FFprobe
----------------
Version: 8.0.1
License: GPL-2.0-or-later for the selected full builds
Sources:
  macOS/Linux: https://ffmpeg.martin-riedl.de/
  Windows: https://github.com/GyanD/codexffmpeg/releases/tag/8.0.1
Corresponding source: https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/tree/release/8.0

Picto invokes FFmpeg and FFprobe as separate subprocesses. Release downloads are pinned and checked
against publisher-provided SHA-256 digests by `scripts/download-ffmpeg.sh`. The selected builds may
contain additional GPL/LGPL/BSD/MIT/ISC/MPL components; the build publisher's configuration and
license inventory are authoritative for the exact archive.


