Optional AI models
------------------
Picto does not bundle AI model weights. A user may explicitly download a pinned, SHA-256-verified
model from its upstream repository. WD14 SwinV2 v3, WD14 EVA02-Large v3, and OppaiOracle V1.1 are
published under Apache-2.0. Z3D E621 ConvNext is labeled `other` by its upstream repository and
does not publish specific redistribution terms; Picto therefore downloads it only from upstream
and does not distribute its weights or a derived Core ML artifact.

Sources:
  https://huggingface.co/SmilingWolf/wd-swinv2-tagger-v3
  https://huggingface.co/SmilingWolf/wd-eva02-large-tagger-v3
  https://huggingface.co/Grio43/OppaiOracle
  https://huggingface.co/toynya/Z3D-E621-Convnext

DanbooruTagQuery/DINOv3 remains developer tooling only and is excluded from the release runtime
until Picto implements the DINOv3 agreement acceptance and retention requirements.


