Generated dependency notices
----------------------------
`npm run generate:license-notices` derives notices from `package-lock.json`, locked Cargo metadata,
and the installed package/crate license files. `npm run release:audit` rejects dependencies without
declared licenses, missing notice packaging, copied audit
artifacts, local absolute paths, and other release hygiene failures.

License expressions in generated notices are the package authors' declarations. A package's own
license text controls if a summary here differs from it.
